{\rtf1\ansi\uc0\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 Times New Roman;}}\f0\fs24 Mara's eyes were blue.\par Ivo crossed the empty square, carrying bread for the travelers.\par "We can rebuild the pier," Mara said. The neighbors brought wood and tools. Together they worked until dawn.\par The lantern shone over the water.\par \u26481\u20140\u32\u55357\u56832}